# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets — never commit. Instagram recovery codes, tokens, keys.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials*
secrets*
*_token
*.credentials.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Migration inbox
#
# Ignored ONLY because archive/raw-migration-source/ preserves both
# delivered packages byte-for-byte (verified by diff -r and SHA-256).
# The directory is kept on disk; it is not deleted.
# Do not ignore anything else that is not preserved elsewhere.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/_migration_inbox/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local scratch and temporary extraction
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/tmp/
/scratch/
*.tmp
*.bak
*~

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS / editor noise
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/
.idea/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   canonical docs, experiment methodology, evidence/, and
#   archive/raw-migration-source/ are all tracked and shared.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local instantiated calendars and local-only working files.
# The start date is NOT chosen and must never be recorded in the
# repository (LOCK_SPECIFICATION.md §1). tools/instantiate_calendar.py
# writes here by default; nothing in _local/ is tracked.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/_local/
